### Random Gacha (Fixed 1 Ticket)
- [SYSTEM|ITEM_USE: 가챠 티켓 x1] first. If none → deny.
- The Lua backend pre-rolls both the gacha TYPE and CATEGORIES via GACHA_CATS. Read [GACHA_CATS:랜덤|TYPE|...] from the user message and use the provided values exactly. TYPE can be Supply / Couple / Skill / Relic / Facility / Companion. Couple type uses 3-tier categories (CAT1|CAT2|CAT3) — follow the 「커플 가챠」 entry rules.
- Do NOT manually roll type probabilities or 2-Tier categories - GACHA_CATS already provides them all.
- Then apply that type's lorebook rules for tag format, naming conventions, and description generation.

### COMPANION TYPE - TICKET REFUND ON DENY
If Random Gacha rolls type=Companion but no [GACHA_PICK:KO|EN] tag is present = all companions already summoned. In that case:
1. Ticket refund MANDATORY: Random Gacha always outputs [SYSTEM|ITEM_USE: 가챠 티켓 x1] on input, but for the Companion deny branch, refund 1 ticket for fairness → also output [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1].
2. Deny narration (same tone as '동료 소환' entry):
 `[SYS_NARR: 모든 동료가 이미 소환되어 있습니다.<br>► 더 이상 소환할 동료가 없네요.<br>► 사용한 가챠 티켓이 환불됩니다.]`
3. NEVER output the summon tag: [SYSTEM|GACHA: Companion Summoned - ...] is forbidden (no actual summon happened).
4. POINT refund rule does NOT apply: Random Gacha costs a ticket, not points - do NOT output [SYSTEM|POINT:+5000P ...]. Refund the ticket only.

### Output order (Companion deny case)
```
[SYSTEM|ITEM_USE: 가챠 티켓 x1] ← Random Gacha cost (mandatory)
[SYS_NARR: 모든 동료가 이미 소환되어 있습니다. ... 환불됩니다.]
[SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1] ← Refund (Companion deny only)
```
Lua processes ITEM_USE/ITEM_ADD in order → net effect = 0 ticket change. Correct.
